Recommends: python3-pyroute2
Description: configurable transparent TCP, UDP and TLS proxy
 Smithproxy is a configurable transparent proxy for TCP, UDP and TLS traffic.
 It includes the proxy daemon, command-line tools, service units and
 certificate management utilities.
